[04/24 20:00:54     17s] 	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
[04/24 20:00:54     17s] 	For post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction, the coupling_c_th value will be used only when the extract_rc_cap_filter_mode parameter of the set_db command is set to relative_and_coupling or relative_or_coupling. Default value of extract_rc_cap_filter_mode parameter in post_route extraction extract_rc_effort_level low is relative_only.
